    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your rodent!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/4c18245a8045d4487f358dbcc46ff2e5.poster.avif?t=1748351796\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/4c18245a8045d4487f358dbcc46ff2e5.webm?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/4c18245a8045d4487f358dbcc46ff2e5.mp4?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard jumpers jump high!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/9a72011870235142bb3a42dc452743ac.poster.avif?t=1748351796\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/9a72011870235142bb3a42dc452743ac.webm?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/9a72011870235142bb3a42dc452743ac.mp4?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double jumpers can leap mid-air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/2a9fb45771182d2bdf595fe02eb2e002.poster.avif?t=1748351796\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/2a9fb45771182d2bdf595fe02eb2e002.webm?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/2a9fb45771182d2bdf595fe02eb2e002.mp4?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flyers levitate!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge obstacles to get further!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/734d365486c83bf4a05b8815ac84a2bd.poster.avif?t=1748351796\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/734d365486c83bf4a05b8815ac84a2bd.webm?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/734d365486c83bf4a05b8815ac84a2bd.mp4?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Smash enemies by jumping on them to get extra score!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/ad3b18a5b2708775e7be8740b54e3d45.poster.avif?t=1748351796\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/ad3b18a5b2708775e7be8740b54e3d45.webm?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/ad3b18a5b2708775e7be8740b54e3d45.mp4?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect cheese to unlock new content!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/60bf65ece5529995bdecd277e6f4a10c.poster.avif?t=1748351796\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/60bf65ece5529995bdecd277e6f4a10c.webm?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713510/extras/60bf65ece5529995bdecd277e6f4a10c.mp4?t=1748351796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now on PC!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PC version of Rat Run is ad-free and features optimized interface and keyboard controls!</p>",
